hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1559","Al-Hussein bin Mahdi told us, he said: Abdul Razzaq told us, and he said: Ikrimah bin Ammar told us, on the authority of Yahya bin Abi Kathir, on the authority of Abu Salamah, On the authority of Aisha, may God be pleased with her, she said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “There are people who will continue to lag behind in the first row until God Almighty will put them in Hell.”"
"1560","He said: Hisham bin Yunus Al-Kufi told us, he said: Al-Qasim bin Malik Al-Muzani told us, on the authority of Al-Jariri, on the authority of Abu Nadra, on the authority of Abu Sa’id He said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, entered and saw people at the back of the mosque. He said: “What is keeping you back?! There are people who continue to stay behind until... God Almighty will delay them. Come forward and follow me, and let those after you follow you.”"
